WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.033
-We got yet another
disturbing glimpse

00:00:03.033 --> 00:00:05.300
of where the GOP is headed this
week when Donald Trump

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:07.334
endorsed Sarah Palin
for a seat in Congress

00:00:07.334 --> 00:00:09.133
and Matt Gaetz
accused the military

00:00:09.133 --> 00:00:11.200
of focusing too much on wokeism.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.801
Meanwhile, President Biden
proposed a new billionaire tax

00:00:13.801 --> 00:00:16.801
aimed at reining in
America's massive wealth gap.

00:00:16.801 --> 00:00:18.767
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:18.767 --> 00:00:23.067
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:23.067 --> 00:00:26.167
There is obviously a lot
going on in the news this week.

00:00:26.167 --> 00:00:28.601
Trump's slow-moving coup
is continuing apace.

00:00:28.601 --> 00:00:31.100
The U.S. and its allies
announced new sanctions

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:32.834
on Russia's barbarism
in Ukraine.

00:00:32.834 --> 00:00:34.801
A new report says it's now
or never

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:36.968
to avert irreversible
climate catastrophe.

00:00:36.968 --> 00:00:39.100
There's a new variant
of a highly contagious

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:41.300
respiratory virus swirling
around out there.

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:42.534
And, on top of all that,

00:00:42.534 --> 00:00:45.067
-Former Alaska governor
and one-time

00:00:45.067 --> 00:00:48.100
Republican vice presidential
nominee Sarah Palin

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:50.534
announced that she's
running for Congress.

00:00:50.534 --> 00:00:51.868
Former President Donald Trump

00:00:51.868 --> 00:00:53.300
has already endorsed her.

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:56.634
-When you get there,
assuming you get there,

00:00:56.634 --> 00:00:59.667
you understand
that the media jackals

00:00:59.667 --> 00:01:01.100
are going to descend on you

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:03.167
and you're going to be walking
down the halls

00:01:03.167 --> 00:01:05.634
to the cafeteria
to go get a Pepsi

00:01:05.634 --> 00:01:07.634
and you're just going
to be swarmed

00:01:07.634 --> 00:01:10.234
by these reporters sticking
these little microphones

00:01:10.234 --> 00:01:12.467
and recording devices
in your face.

00:01:12.467 --> 00:01:14.767
Governor Palin,
Palin, Congresswoman,

00:01:14.767 --> 00:01:16.634
are you prepared
for that onslaught?

00:01:16.634 --> 00:01:19.767
Because it's going to be
pretty vicious.

00:01:19.767 --> 00:01:23.200
-You know, I would never be so
cocky as to say bring it on...

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:24.934
-[ Laughs ]
-...but, yeah.

00:01:24.934 --> 00:01:27.167
I anticipate that,
when I walk down that hall

00:01:27.167 --> 00:01:29.167
to get my Diet Dr Pepper, sure,

00:01:29.167 --> 00:01:32.434
the jackals are going to be
there doing their jackalin'.

00:01:32.434 --> 00:01:34.501
[ Laughter ]
-So, if you've ever stood

00:01:34.501 --> 00:01:36.167
in front of a Coke machine
and wondered,

00:01:36.167 --> 00:01:39.634
"What kind of lunatic
drinks Diet Dr Pepper?"

00:01:39.634 --> 00:01:42.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:42.467 --> 00:01:45.868
But, yes, yes, jackals

00:01:45.868 --> 00:01:48.000
will do their jackalin'.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.000
And, by the way, if you want
to know what a jackal does,

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:51.133
I'm the guy to ask.

00:01:51.133 --> 00:01:53.434
What they do
is leave nitpicky complaints

00:01:53.434 --> 00:01:56.234
in the YouTube comments section
that I then respond to

00:01:56.234 --> 00:01:58.334
in our Emmy-nominated series
"Corrections."

00:01:58.334 --> 00:02:01.000
[ Fanfare plays ]
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:03.968
Which you can see every Monday
at 8:00 pm right here on NBC.

00:02:03.968 --> 00:02:05.434
No? What's that?
Oh, is it on --

00:02:05.434 --> 00:02:07.133
Is it on Peacock?
It's not on Peacock either?

00:02:07.133 --> 00:02:09.334
Oh, it's just on YouTube
every Friday morning?

00:02:09.334 --> 00:02:11.868
Alright, well, I guess
the network hates money.

00:02:11.868 --> 00:02:14.367
[ Laughter ]
It should be noted

00:02:14.367 --> 00:02:16.834
I think Palin is
in for a rude awakening

00:02:16.834 --> 00:02:18.467
if she thinks she's still
in the vanguard

00:02:18.467 --> 00:02:19.868
of wild and crazy Republicans.

00:02:19.868 --> 00:02:22.801
Palin showing up in Congress now
would be like

00:02:22.801 --> 00:02:24.367
me telling a bunch
of high school kids

00:02:24.367 --> 00:02:26.167
about my wild days
of sneaking out

00:02:26.167 --> 00:02:27.834
and drinking wine coolers
in the woods

00:02:27.834 --> 00:02:30.734
and then realizing I was talking
to the kids from "Euphoria."

00:02:30.734 --> 00:02:32.100
They'd be like, "Cool, old man.

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:33.667
I put Molly on my oatmeal."

00:02:33.667 --> 00:02:35.334
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:35.334 --> 00:02:37.701
In fact, as if to prove
that Sarah Palin, somehow,

00:02:37.701 --> 00:02:39.534
would not be the craziest
Republican in Congress,

00:02:39.534 --> 00:02:41.467
if she won,
Florida Congressman Matt Gaetz,

00:02:41.467 --> 00:02:43.634
who looks like he wished
on a monkey's paw

00:02:43.634 --> 00:02:44.968
he'd make it
to Major League Baseball

00:02:44.968 --> 00:02:46.501
and, instead,
got Mr. Met's head,

00:02:46.501 --> 00:02:48.868
[ Laughter ]
leveled

00:02:48.868 --> 00:02:50.934
a bunch of unhinged
conspiracy theories

00:02:50.934 --> 00:02:52.934
at Defense Secretary
Lloyd Austin yesterday,

00:02:52.934 --> 00:02:55.934
claiming the military cares more
about critical race theory

00:02:55.934 --> 00:02:57.901
and wokeism
than national defense.

00:02:57.901 --> 00:03:01.634
-What in the $773 billion
that you're requesting today

00:03:01.634 --> 00:03:03.634
is going to help you
make assessments

00:03:03.634 --> 00:03:07.000
that are accurate in the face
of so many blown calls?

00:03:10.934 --> 00:03:12.367
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.367 --> 00:03:14.434
-You've seen what's
in our budget.

00:03:14.434 --> 00:03:17.000
You've seen how the budget
matches the strategy

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:18.934
and so I'll let that speak
for itself.

00:03:18.934 --> 00:03:20.434
-Everyone else
in the world seems

00:03:20.434 --> 00:03:22.968
to be developing capabilities
and being more strategic.

00:03:22.968 --> 00:03:26.067
We got time to embrace critical
race theory at West Point,

00:03:26.067 --> 00:03:28.834
to embrace socialism at the
National Defense University,

00:03:28.834 --> 00:03:31.067
to do mandatory
pronoun training.

00:03:31.067 --> 00:03:33.100
Do you assess --
-You know,

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:35.033
again, this is the most capable,

00:03:35.033 --> 00:03:37.868
the most combat-critical,
force in the world.

00:03:37.868 --> 00:03:40.834
It has been and it will be so
going forward.

00:03:40.834 --> 00:03:42.100
-Not if we continue
down this path.
-And this budget helps us

00:03:42.100 --> 00:03:43.801
to do that.
-Not if we embrace socialism.

00:03:43.801 --> 00:03:48.300
You guys said that Russia would
overrun Ukraine in 36 days.

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:51.000
You said that the Taliban
would be kept at bay for months.

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.701
You totally blew those calls.

00:03:52.701 --> 00:03:54.667
And maybe we would be better
at them

00:03:54.667 --> 00:03:56.434
if the
National Defense University

00:03:56.434 --> 00:03:58.334
actually worked
a little more on strategy

00:03:58.334 --> 00:03:59.767
and a little less on wokeism.

00:03:59.767 --> 00:04:02.601
-Has it occurred to you that
Russia has not overrun Ukraine

00:04:02.601 --> 00:04:05.534
because of what we've done
and our allies have done?

00:04:05.534 --> 00:04:07.501
-It seems the Biden
administration is trying

00:04:07.501 --> 00:04:09.934
to destroy our military
by force, feeding it wokeism.

00:04:09.934 --> 00:04:11.234
-What is wrong
with these people?

00:04:11.234 --> 00:04:14.000
In their fever swamp brains,
do they genuinely believe

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:16.334
our soldiers no longer know how
to fire a rifle

00:04:16.334 --> 00:04:18.701
because they are buried
in homework from pronoun class?

00:04:18.701 --> 00:04:21.067
[ Laughter ]
Does he think they arrive
on the battlefield

00:04:21.067 --> 00:04:23.434
and the sergeant barks out,
"Alright, Bravo Team,

00:04:23.434 --> 00:04:25.267
go around the left flank
and tell the enemy

00:04:25.267 --> 00:04:26.634
they're beautiful
just the way they are.

00:04:26.634 --> 00:04:28.534
[ Laughter ]
Charlie Team,
circle those drums.

00:04:28.534 --> 00:04:30.234
The rest of you,
into the Prius"?

00:04:30.234 --> 00:04:31.801
[ Laughter ]
Also,

00:04:31.801 --> 00:04:33.033
I would just like to point out

00:04:33.033 --> 00:04:34.534
I have no problem
with tough questioning

00:04:34.534 --> 00:04:35.868
of our national
security officials

00:04:35.868 --> 00:04:37.400
and I'm all for cutting
the defense budget.

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:38.901
It's massively inflated
and we can

00:04:38.901 --> 00:04:40.934
absolutely spend it better
elsewhere.

00:04:40.934 --> 00:04:42.767
But that's not even
what the scam artists,

00:04:42.767 --> 00:04:44.167
like Gaetz, are asking for.

00:04:44.167 --> 00:04:45.634
They just want to whine
about wokeism

00:04:45.634 --> 00:04:46.767
and critical race theory.

00:04:46.767 --> 00:04:49.367
They don't actually want
to cut defense spending,

00:04:49.367 --> 00:04:51.534
as Gaetz made clear in this part
of the exchange,

00:04:51.534 --> 00:04:54.067
where he claimed we were behind
on a certain type

00:04:54.067 --> 00:04:56.834
of defense technology,
without providing much proof.

00:04:56.834 --> 00:04:58.501
-We're behind in hypersonics.

00:04:58.501 --> 00:05:00.067
We failed to deter Russia.

00:05:00.067 --> 00:05:02.367
Last year --
-What do you mean,

00:05:02.367 --> 00:05:04.033
