00:05:13.167 --> 00:05:14.734
and we are still
developing them.

00:05:14.734 --> 00:05:16.334
-How do you know we're behind
in hypersonics?

00:05:16.334 --> 00:05:18.367
"I don't know."
Do you know what hypersonic is?

00:05:18.367 --> 00:05:20.334
"I know that,
according to Sarah Palin,

00:05:20.334 --> 00:05:21.934
they do a lot of hypersonickin'.

00:05:21.934 --> 00:05:24.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:24.467 --> 00:05:27.400
These people -- Trump, Palin,
Gaetz, Marjorie Taylor Greene --

00:05:27.400 --> 00:05:28.567
are very much the present

00:05:28.567 --> 00:05:29.868
and the future
of the Republican Party,

00:05:29.868 --> 00:05:31.267
