for many reasons.

00:05:31.267 --> 00:05:33.734
For one thing, they all try
to pass themselves off

00:05:33.734 --> 00:05:35.033
as pro-worker populists,

00:05:35.033 --> 00:05:37.200
while the left is actually going
after elite wealth

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:39.701
and trying to redistribute
that money to better uses

00:05:39.701 --> 00:05:41.367
that would benefit poor
and working Americans.

00:05:41.367 --> 00:05:43.534
For example, the Biden
administration is proposing

00:05:43.534 --> 00:05:45.567
a new minimum tax
on billionaires.

00:05:45.567 --> 00:05:47.601
-Today, the Biden administration
expected to announce

00:05:47.601 --> 00:05:49.167
a new tax for billionaires.

00:05:49.167 --> 00:05:52.100
The minimum income tax
would require households

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:54.367
with more than $100 million

00:05:54.367 --> 00:05:57.467
to pay a rate of at least
20% of their full income.

00:05:57.467 --> 00:06:02.601
-A 20% minimum tax that applies
only to the top 1/100 of 1%.

00:06:02.601 --> 00:06:05.767
1/100 of 1% of the Americans
will pay this tax.

00:06:05.767 --> 00:06:10.367
I'm asking you one simple --
just pay your fair share.

00:06:10.367 --> 00:06:11.767
Pay your fair share, that's all.

00:06:11.767 --> 00:06:12.968
That's it.

00:06:12.968 --> 00:06:15.033
Just your fair share.

00:06:15.033 --> 00:06:20.701
And no one can argue that 20%
for a billionaire is unfair.

00:06:20.701 --> 00:06:22.901
-I love when Biden stares
down the barrel of the camera

00:06:22.901 --> 00:06:24.267
and goes into his whisper voice.

00:06:24.267 --> 00:06:27.000
It feels like your future self
time traveled here

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:28.868
to warn you about something.
[ Laughter ]

00:06:28.868 --> 00:06:31.667
[ As Biden ]
I'm telling you, you got to dump
all your Peloton stock.

00:06:31.667 --> 00:06:33.300
[ Laughter ]

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:34.801
Go get that mole looked at.

00:06:34.801 --> 00:06:37.534
[ Laughter ]
Now, I haven't spoken
to any myself,

00:06:37.534 --> 00:06:40.033
