are happy about this.

00:06:40.033 --> 00:06:41.667
-Damn right we're not.
-What?!

00:06:41.667 --> 00:06:44.367
[ Laughter ]
Wally, you're
a billionaire, how?!

00:06:44.367 --> 00:06:47.467
-Seth, 20 years ago,
I was visited by my future self

00:06:47.467 --> 00:06:49.267
and he told me
to buy Amazon stock.

00:06:49.267 --> 00:06:50.634
[ Laughter ]
-Why don't you tell me?

00:06:50.634 --> 00:06:52.667
-Well, my future self told me
you couldn't be trusted.

00:06:52.667 --> 00:06:55.634
[ Laughter ]
-Well, I'd like to have a few
words with your future self.

00:06:55.634 --> 00:06:58.434
-That's me. Present day Wally
is the future self

00:06:58.434 --> 00:07:00.067
[ Laughter ]
that talked to me 20 years ago.

00:07:00.067 --> 00:07:02.234
-I don't want to waste another
"Closer Look"

00:07:02.234 --> 00:07:04.634
-[Both] talking
about time travel with you!

00:07:04.634 --> 00:07:06.968
[ Laughter ]
-I told me you'd say that.

00:07:06.968 --> 00:07:10.834
[ Laughter ]

00:07:10.834 --> 00:07:12.701
-Alright!
Anyway.

00:07:12.701 --> 00:07:14.601
[ Laughter ]
Billionaires and their
allies in Congress

00:07:14.601 --> 00:07:17.667
get so emotionally wounded
at even the suggestion

00:07:17.667 --> 00:07:19.801
that maybe our tax system
favors the wealthy,

00:07:19.801 --> 00:07:21.033
like during Biden's
State of the Union,

00:07:21.033 --> 00:07:23.767
when he said
Trump's $2 trillion tax cuts

00:07:23.767 --> 00:07:26.400
largely benefited the top 1%,
which is true.

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:30.167
And Republicans audibly booed,
leading to an awkward moment

00:07:30.167 --> 00:07:33.601
where Chuck Schumer preemptively
stood up to clap the next line,

00:07:33.601 --> 00:07:35.868
but was interrupted
by the Republican booing.

00:07:35.868 --> 00:07:38.033
-Unlike the $2 trillion
tax cut passed

00:07:38.033 --> 00:07:39.934
in the previous administration,

00:07:39.934 --> 00:07:42.033
that benefited
the top 1% of Americans,

00:07:42.033 --> 00:07:43.267
the American Rescue Plan --

00:07:43.267 --> 00:07:46.100
[ Booing ]

00:07:46.100 --> 00:07:48.300
[ Laughter ]
the American Rescue Plan

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:51.167
helped working people
and left no one behind.

00:07:51.167 --> 00:07:53.200
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:56.501
-It's like a dance mom who gets
up to applaud for her daughter

00:07:56.501 --> 00:08:00.167
