to explain it to all of us.

00:08:45.667 --> 00:08:49.767
-President Biden has announced
a $5.8 trillion budget proposal

00:08:49.767 --> 00:08:54.100
for the 2023 fiscal year,
which includes a wealth tax

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:56.167
