in the country.

00:08:56.167 --> 00:08:58.968
Households with assets
of more than $100 million

00:08:58.968 --> 00:09:02.334
would face a minimum tax of 20%.

00:09:02.334 --> 00:09:04.734
So, here to discuss is
Mick Mulvaney.

00:09:04.734 --> 00:09:08.133
He's a former
Office of Management
and Budget director

00:09:08.133 --> 00:09:10.267
and today I am pleased
to welcome him

00:09:10.267 --> 00:09:11.634
as a CBS News contributor.

00:09:11.634 --> 00:09:13.334
So happy to have you here.

00:09:13.334 --> 00:09:14.334
Thank you so much.

00:09:14.334 --> 00:09:15.868
You're the guy
to ask about this.

00:09:15.868 --> 00:09:16.868
-No, he's not!

00:09:16.868 --> 00:09:18.234
[ Laughter ]
He's Donald Trump's

00:09:18.234 --> 00:09:19.667
former chief of staff.

00:09:19.667 --> 00:09:22.601
He's not just some budget wonk
who's giving nonpartisan advice.

00:09:22.601 --> 00:09:24.067
Calling him a former

00:09:24.067 --> 00:09:25.934
Office of Management
and Budget director

00:09:25.934 --> 00:09:28.434
and leaving out the Trump part
is like saying there were

00:09:28.434 --> 00:09:31.334
