that Will Smith did like.

00:09:31.334 --> 00:09:33.701
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:09:33.701 --> 00:09:36.834
We're facing a litany of serious
existential crises right now,

00:09:36.834 --> 00:09:38.667
from impending climate disaster

00:09:38.667 --> 00:09:40.601
to the pandemic,
to wealth inequality,

00:09:40.601 --> 00:09:42.868
